    "id": "rate_half_mca_rank11_kernel_multibasis_decoration_compression",
    "title": "Every kernel incidence carries at least d+2 basis decorations",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "loopless-matroid fundamental-circuit exchange and all-bases double counting",
    "statement": "A rank-(10-d) evaluation matroid on a kernel-lane eleven-set is loopless and has at least d+2 bases. Decorating every incidence by all its bases leaves the existing fixed-basis cap valid and improves the corank-d aggregate capacity to floor(C(n',10-d) M_d C(K'-10,d+1)/(d+2)). The factor d+2 is sharp under looplessness alone.",
